====== TP-Link CPE510/CPE520 ======
TP-Link CPE510/520 is a 5 GHz outdoor access point similar to [[toh:ubiquiti:nanostationm2|Ubiquiti NanoStations]]. There is also a 2.4 GHz Version of this AP, the [[toh:tp-link:cpe210|TP-Link CPE210/220]]. The device has a built-in 13 dBi 2x2 dual-polarized directional MIMO antenna with a beamwidth of 45° (H-Plane) and 30° (E-Plane).

{{media:tplink:cpe210.png|TP-Link CPE510}}

